---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Morgan Henley Presents | About">
	<main class="about">
		<header class="about-heading"><p class="kicker">02 / The signal behind the noise</p><h1>Built for<br /><em>the valley.</em></h1></header>
		<div class="about-grid">
			<div class="about-lead"><p>Morgan Henley Presents is an independent production company making room for live music, good people, and the kind of nights that travel by word of mouth.</p><a href="mailto:morganhenleypresents@gmail.com">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a></div>
			<div class="about-copy"><p>Founded in the Snoqualmie Valley in 2016, MHP brings together musicians, artists, businesses, and neighbors through events with a strong sense of place.</p><p>From Duvall Days and Carnation's 4th of July Celebration to Railroad Days, Rock the Nation, and BrodieNation Music Festival, the work is always rooted in community and built to feel alive.</p><p>Across more than a decade in the Pacific Northwest entertainment scene, Morgan has helped shape stages at venues throughout the Valley and beyond.</p></div>
		</div>
		<section class="credits"><p class="kicker">Selected history</p><div class="credit-row"><strong>01</strong><span>BrodieProductions</span><small>2006—2012 / Carnation + Seattle</small></div><div class="credit-row"><strong>02</strong><span>People w/ Instruments</span><small>2011—2016 / Festivals + community</small></div><div class="credit-row"><strong>03</strong><span>MHP</span><small>2016—now / Snoqualmie Valley</small></div></section>
	</main>
</Layout>
<style>
	.about { width: min(1000px, calc(100% - 3rem)); margin: auto; padding: 7rem 0 3rem; }
	.kicker { margin: 0; color: var(--signal); font: 500 .68rem/1.2 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.about-heading { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom: 4rem; }
	h1 { margin: 1.5rem 0 0; font: 600 clamp(5rem, 14vw, 10rem)/.75 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.07em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	h1 em { color: var(--signal); font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; }
	.about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 9rem); padding: 5rem 0 8rem; }
	.about-lead p { margin: 0 0 2rem; font: 500 clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.3rem)/1.05 var(--display); text-transform: uppercase; }
	.about-lead a { color: var(--signal); font: 500 .7rem var(--mono); letter-spacing: .08em; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.about-lead a span { font-size: 1.1rem; }
	.about-copy { color: var(--muted); font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.7; }
	.about-copy p { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
	.credits { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 1.5rem; }
	.credit-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50px 1fr 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.2rem 0; }
	.credit-row strong { color: var(--signal); font: 500 .7rem var(--mono); } .credit-row span { font: 500 1.5rem var(--display); text-transform: uppercase; } .credit-row small { color: var(--muted); font: .65rem var(--mono); text-align: right; }
	@media (max-width: 640px) { .about { width: calc(100% - 2rem); padding-top: 4rem; } .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; padding: 4rem 0 5rem; } .credit-row { grid-template-columns: 35px 1fr; } .credit-row small { grid-column: 2; text-align: left; } }
</style>
